Staged production import trigger.

Changing this file on the working branch fires
.github/workflows/staged-import-once.yml — the first controlled
--max-players 2000 import against the production database.

Trigger 1: 2026-08-20, after the local dress rehearsal passed end-to-end
(2,120 players, 64,048 valuations, 22,192 transfers, 27,597 season-stat
rows, 13,240 Reep v1 identities, verify PASS on Lukas Hradecky).
Outcome: hollow green — the repository secrets are not configured, and the
pre-pipefail workflow let `| tee` mask the preflight failure.

Trigger 2: 2026-08-20, with pipefail enforced. Outcome: honest red at
preflight — repository secrets not configured.

Trigger 3: 2026-08-20. The Supabase project URL is now baked into the
workflow env (public by design), so exactly ONE secret remains required:
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY under Settings → Secrets and variables →
Actions. If it exists by the time this fires, the staged import runs; if
not, preflight names it and stops.
